{"_":"Positioned text items [str, x, y, width, fontSize] per page, snapshot of the public USA COB/COC BSHM HM 5 syllabus template (pages 1-7).","pages":[{"width":936,"height":612,"items":[["University of San Agustin",356.3,567.3,194.7,16],["College of Business",385.4,550.3,133.7,14],["General Luna St., Iloilo City",361.3,534.2,181.9,14],["Department of Hospitality Management",322.4,518.1,259.7,14],["Document No.",675.8,570.8,70.3,11],["USA-COC-SYL-___ (Lec)",774.8,570.8,125.2,11],["Revision No.",675.8,556.6,62.3,11],["00",774.8,556.6,12.2,11],["Date of Effectivity",675.8,543.2,85.3,11],["July ____, 2023",774.8,543.2,77.6,11],["Issued by",675.8,529.8,47.1,11],["COC",774.8,529.8,24.4,11],["Page No.",675.8,515.7,45.8,11],["Page",774.8,515.7,25.7,11],["1",803.5,515.7,6.1,11],["of",812.6,515.7,9.2,11],["10",824.9,515.7,12.2,11],["COURSE SPECIFICATIONS FOR",138.1,486.1,183.1,12],["HM 5/HM5A- APPLIED BUSINESS TOOLS & TECHNOLOGIES IN HOSPITALITY",327.6,486.1,442.9,12],["AUGUSTINIAN PHILOSOPHY OF EDUCATION:",18.8,472.5,241,11],["“Augustinian Education is a Christ-centered, learner-centered, life-long process anchored on Augustinian values, which presupposes a holistic vision of the human person. It strives to",18.8,459.8,884.1,11],["form individuals by engaging students actively in the learning process and by offering flexible inquiry-based educational programs and support services geared towards the acquisition of",18.8,447.2,896.8,11],["necessary knowledge and fundamental Christian moral formation. Graduates are expected to become critical thinkers, lovers of Truth, agents of transformation, and responsible",18.8,434.5,855,11],["community builders.”",18.8,421.9,101.4,11],["VISION:",18.8,405,40.9,11],["A premier academic community of life-long learners",62.7,405,250.5,11],["working with one mind and one heart to search for, discover and",18.8,392.3,311.6,11],["share the Truth (",18.8,379.7,80.8,11],["Gaudium de Veritate",99.6,379.7,100.4,11],[") for the promotion of",200,379.7,102,11],["authentic human and societal development.",18.8,367,212,11],["MISSION:",354,405,50.1,11],["The University of San Agustin is an",407.1,405,171.1,11],["Augustinian, Catholic and Filipino educational institution",354,392.3,271.3,11],["that aims to form the members of its academic",354,379.7,225.4,11],["community in",354,367,64.8,11],["Virtus et Scientia",421.8,367,82.3,11],["to serve Western",507.1,367,82.9,11],["Visayas, the Philippines and the world.",354,354.4,188,11],["AUGUSTINIAN GRADUATE ATTRIBUTES",636,405,212.7,11],["An Augustinian graduate is:",636,392.3,134.4,11],["A.",636,379.7,10.4,11],["A transformative community builder oriented",672,379.7,215.1,11],["towards God.",636,367,65.4,11],["B.",636,354.4,10.4,11],["A restless critical and creative thinker.",672,354.4,183.9,11],["C.",636,341.7,11,11],["A social communicator of the Truth.",672,341.7,172.5,11],["PROGRAM EDUCATIONAL OBJECTIVES (PEO)",18.8,328.3,245.9,11],["PROGRAM OUTCOMES (PO)",495,328.3,150.2,11],["After 3 to 5 years, the",18.8,314.8,105.1,11],["BSHM",126.9,314.8,32.4,11],["graduates shall be:",162.3,314.8,92.9,11],["By the time of graduation, the students of the",495,314.8,218.8,11],["BSHM",716.8,314.8,32.4,11],["program shall have the ability to:",752.2,314.8,158.3,11],["1. Practicing Hospitality Management professionals with strong Augustinian values in their",18.8,301.3,436.9,11],["chosen fields of specialization, employed or engaged in entrepreneurial endeavors in the",18.8,288.7,430.8,11],["Hospitality Management industry.",18.8,276,161.7,11],["A. Demonstrate knowledge of tourism industry, local tourism products and services",495,288.7,401.8,11],["2. Qualified/certified professionals in the field of Hospitality Management that are firmly",18.8,262.1,421,11],["committed to ethical and sustainable development.",18.8,249.5,246.9,11],["B. Interpret and apply relevant laws related to tourism industry",495,255.8,301.8,11],["3. Hotel and Restaurant industry leaders with technical competence, who are innovative, and",18.8,235.6,450.9,11],["creative, with effective communication skills in the execution of managerial skills and the",18.8,223,428.1,11],["training of personnel.",18.8,210.3,102.7,11],["C. Observe and perform risk mitigation activities",495,223,233.4,11],["4. Members/officers of both private and public offices with strong leadership and team spirit in",18.8,196.4,453.6,11],["their professional work.",18.8,183.8,113,11],["D. Utilize information technology applications for tourism and hospitality",495,190.1,347,11],["5. Industry stakeholders involved in MICE, committed to updating skills and knowledge, keeping",18.8,169.4,465,11],["with industry trends, to sustain their ability to compete in the global market.",18.8,156.8,362.9,11],["E. Manage and market a service-oriented business organization",495,163.1,311,11],["F. Demonstrate administrative and managerial skills in a service-oriented business",495,142.4,399.6,11],["organization",495,129.8,59.9,11],["G. Prepare and monitor industry specific financial transactions and reports",495,109.1,360.5,11],["H. Perform human capital development functions of a tourism oriented organization",495,82.1,403.9,11]]},{"width":936,"height":612,"items":[["University of San Agustin",356.3,567.3,194.7,16],["College of Business",385.4,550.3,133.7,14],["General Luna St., Iloilo City",361.3,534.2,181.9,14],["Department of Hospitality Management",322.4,518.1,259.7,14],["Document No.",675.8,570.8,70.3,11],["USA-COC-SYL-___ (Lec)",774.8,570.8,125.2,11],["Revision No.",675.8,556.6,62.3,11],["00",774.8,556.6,12.2,11],["Date of Effectivity",675.8,543.2,85.3,11],["July ____, 2023",774.8,543.2,77.6,11],["Issued by",675.8,529.8,47.1,11],["COC",774.8,529.8,24.4,11],["Page No.",675.8,515.7,45.8,11],["Page",774.8,515.7,25.7,11],["2",803.5,515.7,6.1,11],["of",812.6,515.7,9.2,11],["10",824.9,515.7,12.2,11],["Course Title",24.3,429,69.1,12],["Applied",127.5,448.3,36.7,11],["Business Tools",109.2,435.7,73.3,11],["& Technolog